   "7880": "<html><head>\n<title>Health, Safety &amp; Environment Manager, Enfield, United Kingdom | Warburtons Careers</title>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Warburtons Careers\"/>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"JobPosting\", \"title\": \"Health, Safety & Environment Manager\", \"description\": \"<h3><strong>The Recipe</strong></h3><p>&#13;</p><p>Safety is our number one priority. As part of the site leadership team, you’ll partner with the General Manager to strengthen our HSE culture across a complex, 24/7 food manufacturing and high‑throughput distribution environment. You’ll coach, influence and enable c.460 colleagues at Enfield—and support our South‑East depots—to go home safe, every day, while protecting the environment.</p><h3><strong>The Role</strong></h3><p>&#13;</p><ul><li><strong>Deliver our national HSE strategy locally</strong>—turn policy into practice, embed best‑in‑cla\", \"identifier\": {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warburtons\", \"value\": \"7880\"}, \"mainEntityOfPage\": \"https://careers.warburtons.co.uk/jobs/7880/health-safety-environment-manager/\", \"url\": \"https://careers.warburtons.co.uk/jobs/7880/health-safety-environment-manager/\", \"baseSalary\": {\"@type\": \"MonetaryAmount\", \"currency\": \"GBP\", \"value\": {\"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\", \"maxValue\": 72000, \"minValue\": 64000, \"unitText\": \"YEAR\"}}, \"datePosted\": \"2026-09-10\", \"directApply\": true, \"employmentType\": \"FULL_TIME\", \"hiringOrganization\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Warburtons\", \"sameAs\": [\"https://x.com/Warburtons\", \"https://www.facebook.com/warburtonsrecruitment\", \"https://www.linkedin.com/company/warburtons\", \"https://www.youtube.com/user/Warburtonsuk\", \"https://www.instagram.com/warburtonsuk\", \"https://www.glassdoor.co.uk/Overview/Working-at-Warburtons-EI_IE36731.11,21.htm\"], \"url\": \"https://warburtons.co.uk/\", \"logo\": \"https: